From: reelee81 <reelee81@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:36:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 15/18] fitz: Saturate the edge colour values of mesh shadings.

prepare_edge() converted the colour values and steps of a triangle edge
to 16.16 fixed point with a plain cast. For an edge that is almost
horizontal the step is huge and the conversion overflows: x86 gives
INT_MIN, ARM saturates at the int limits. The conversion now saturates
on every platform (NaN as 0), as ARM did, and step_edge() adds the steps
with the same wrap-around as before, but without signed overflow. ARM
output is unchanged and x86 matches it. Adds fz_saturate_float_to_int()
to draw-imp.h.

Modified for ReePDF on 2026-11-12.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 source/fitz/draw-imp.h  | 12 ++++++++++++
 source/fitz/draw-mesh.c |  6 +++---
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/source/fitz/draw-imp.h b/source/fitz/draw-imp.h
index 71ca2a8..efed526 100644
--- a/source/fitz/draw-imp.h
+++ b/source/fitz/draw-imp.h
@@ -26,6 +26,18 @@
 #define BBOX_MIN -(1<<20)
 #define BBOX_MAX (1<<20)
 
+/* convert to int, saturating at the limits, NaN as 0 */
+static inline int fz_saturate_float_to_int(float f)
+{
+	if (f >= 2147483648.0f)
+		return 2147483647;
+	if (f < -2147483648.0f)
+		return -2147483647 - 1;
+	if (f != f)
+		return 0;
+	return (int)f;
+}
+
 /* divide and floor towards -inf */
 static inline int fz_idiv(int a, int b)
 {
diff --git a/source/fitz/draw-mesh.c b/source/fitz/draw-mesh.c
index 941e6c7..27360a6 100644
--- a/source/fitz/draw-mesh.c
+++ b/source/fitz/draw-mesh.c
@@ -104,8 +104,8 @@ static inline void prepare_edge(const float *FZ_RESTRICT vtop, const float *FZ_R
 	for (i = 0; i < n; i++)
 	{
 		diff = vbot[i+2] - vtop[i+2];
-		edge->v[i] = (int)(65536.0f * (vtop[i+2] + diff * t));
-		edge->v[i+MAXN] = (int)(65536.0f * diff * r);
+		edge->v[i] = fz_saturate_float_to_int(65536.0f * (vtop[i+2] + diff * t));
+		edge->v[i+MAXN] = fz_saturate_float_to_int(65536.0f * diff * r);
 	}
 }
 
@@ -117,7 +117,7 @@ static inline void step_edge(edge_data *edge, int n)
 
 	for (i = 0; i < n; i++)
 	{
-		edge->v[i] += edge->v[i + MAXN];
+		edge->v[i] = (int)((unsigned int)edge->v[i] + (unsigned int)edge->v[i + MAXN]);
 	}
 }
 
